    "live_boat_tests": "Two ignored entrypoints compiled, not executed"
  },
  "behavior_observed": [
    "SDK-owned files and nested directories synced bottom-up before sibling rename, followed by canonical parent ancestry; injected failure refuses acknowledgment and preserves previous artifact.",
    "Post-rename sync failure leaves visible uncertain artifact; same import validates stored bundle and cached Git tree and resyncs before acknowledgment.",
    "Constructor retries sync even already-visible ancestors through filesystem root; failure propagates.",
    "Export rejects cached-tree corruption and sync failure before readiness acknowledgment, while valid bytes remain identical.",
    "Three real native integration tests serialize/transfer complete public bundles to separate local artifact and authority stores; disposable source project/artifact/registry directories are removed before fresh controller recovery.",
    "Continuation binary is inside checkpoint; counter advances0to1, binary payload persists; same-request controller reopen retains RunRef, workspace and post-launch sentinel.",
    "Corrupt/truncated new bundle refuses admission and previous authority/head remains recoverable; lost Started acknowledgment is resolved through surviving authority without another increment.",
    "Abandoned empty/partial-header/partial-body HTTP connections never reach fake provider handler; subsequent exact durable create succeeds."
  ],
  "test_method": "Ordering and failure tests were written before production seams; executed callback failures route through actual constructor/capture/import/export logic. No new production mutation probes or hardware power-cut tests performed.",
  "findings_and_fixes": [
    {
      "severity": "P2",
      "finding": "Corruption tests initially targeted repo/objects in a non-bare repo",
      "resolution": "Corrected to repo/.git/objects before first gate; reviewed actual init_repo and reran full gate"
    },
    {
      "severity": "runtime failure",
      "finding": "First gate exposed preexisting Boat fake-server panic on canceled incomplete HTTP and35ms test timing sensitivity",
      "resolution": "Discard incomplete connections before recording effects; added regression. Test-only request500ms/cleanup1s/poll25ms; production deadlines and all completion/identity/count assertions unchanged."
    }
  ],
